{
  "name": "@opencode-ai/app",
  "version": "1.17.8",
  "description": "",
  "type": "module",
  "_fork_notes": {
    "conditions=browser": "FORK 必需(REQ-104,原始来源 commit defc4fe3ea):test:unit / test:unit:watch 的 --conditions=browser 不可删。缺了 bun 会把 solid-js 解析到 server 构建,createEffect 变 no-op,effect 不执行。2026-08-09 实测:删掉它跑全量 = 604 pass / 2 fail,两条都在 src/pages/layout/project-restore.test.ts,但报错内容只指向该文件的业务逻辑、不会提示是本参数丢了 —— 极易被误诊成 merge 引入的代码问题。上游 merge 撞到本文件时务必保留该参数;.husky/pre-commit §4.6 有断言会拦。详见 docs/governance/UPSTREAM-MERGE-GUIDE.md"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": "./src/index.ts",
    "./desktop-menu": "./src/desktop-menu.ts",
    "./desktop-menu-i18n": "./src/desktop-menu-i18n.ts",
    "./updater": "./src/updater.ts",
    "./wsl/types": "./src/wsl/types.ts",
    "./vite": "./vite.js",
    "./index.css": "./src/index.css"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "typecheck": "tsgo -b",
    "start": "vite",
    "dev": "vite",
    "build": "vite build",
    "serve": "vite preview",
    "test": "bun run test:unit && bun run test:virtualizer",
    "test:unit": "bun test --only-failures --preload ./happydom.ts --conditions=browser ./src",
    "test:virtualizer": "bun test --conditions=browser --preload ./happydom.ts ./test-browser/solid-virtual.test.ts",
    "test:unit:watch": "bun test --watch --preload ./happydom.ts --conditions=browser ./src",
    "test:e2e": "playwright test",
    "test:e2e:local": "playwright test",
    "test:e2e:ui": "playwright test --ui",
    "test:e2e:web-share": "playwright test -c playwright.web-share.deskfox.config.ts",
    "test:e2e:report": "playwright show-report e2e/playwright-report"
  },
